cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Publication List Generator"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based tool that builds an auto-updating publication list for a
  researcher, laboratory or research group. It assembles records from ORCID,
  PubMed and researchmap, enriches their metadata with OpenAlex and Crossref,
  de-duplicates and categorises them, and emits a formatted list in one of five
  citation styles. The generated embed snippet can carry a pre-rendered snapshot
  and refreshes itself in each visitor's browser, so a laboratory publication
  page stays current without a server, an account, an API key or any scheduled
  job. Additional outputs cover article reference lists, WordPress block markup,
  Markdown, BibTeX and RIS.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Yuki
    family-names: Furukawa
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1317-0220"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ykfrkw/publication-list"
url: "https://ykfrkw.github.io/publication-list/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - publication list
  - bibliography
  - ORCID
  - PubMed
  - OpenAlex
  - researchmap
  - Crossref
  - research software
